# Sin Hunting (windurst 72): its Windurst Woods lines next to The Fanged One's (the reply kinds). A level-40 RNG with
# The Fanged One accepted by GM at Prog 0: its 352 (Perih Vashai), 354 (Kapeh Myohrye) and 353 (Muhk Johldy) are Events
# with no finish handler, answering on every talk. Ties rotate by the last event id (the next action in the list after
# it); with none, the first action in the list plays, here Sin Hunting's. Perih Vashai's script answers nothing here
# (Sin Hunting not completed). Available: 523 (Progress) over 352 on both talks (option 1: nothing; then option 0,
# begun; a tie would give 352 after 523). Prog 0: 524 and 352 tie and take turns. Kapeh Myohrye: 526 and 354 take turns;
# Muhk Johldy: 525 and 353 take turns. Prog 4 (GM): 527 (Progress) over 352 on both talks (a full bag: the completion
# fails; then completed). Completed: Kapeh Myohrye's 530 and Muhk Johldy's 529 (replaceDefault) lose to 354 and 353
# (Events).
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Kapeh_Myohrye/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Muhk_Johldy/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/523 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/527
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=119.5,-3.7,90.45 job=RNG lvl=40
quest Windurst.TheFangedOne accepted
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # available: 523 (Progress) over 352
finish option=1                               # nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 523 again (523 played last: a tie would give 352)
finish option=0                               # begun
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # Prog 0: 524 and 352 tie: 524 (first in the list)
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 352
finish
trigger Kapeh_Myohrye                         # 526 and 354 tie: 526
finish
trigger Kapeh_Myohrye                         # 354
finish
trigger Muhk_Johldy                           # 525 and 353 tie: 525
finish
trigger Muhk_Johldy                           # 353
finish
charvar Quest[2][72]Prog 4                    # GM
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # Prog 4: 527 (Progress) over 352
fill-inventory
finish                                        # the bow does not fit: nothing
free-inventory
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 527 again (527 played last: a tie would give 352)
finish                                        # completed
trigger Kapeh_Myohrye                         # completed: 530 (replaceDefault) under 354
finish
trigger Muhk_Johldy                           # 529 (replaceDefault) under 353
finish
